.TH SL 1 "October 23, 2026" "sl 7.01"
.SH NAME
sl \- cure your bad habit of mistyping
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sl
[
.B \-abcFGhilLr3
] [
.B \-n
.I cars
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sl
is a highly advanced animation program for curing your bad habit of mistyping.
It cannot be interrupted.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-accident
An accident is occurring. People cry for help.
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-backwards
The train runs from left to right.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-C51
C51 appears instead of D51.
.TP
.BR \-F ", " \-\-fly
It flies like the galaxy express 999.
.TP
.BR \-G ", " \-\-TGV
It's French like Oscar.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-ICE
A German ICE 1 appears.
.TP
.BR \-3 ", " \-\-ICE3RD
A German ICE 3 (redesign) appears.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-little
Little version.
.TP
.BR \-L ", " \-\-land
The train comes down to land.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-repeat
The train keeps coming. Press
.B q
to stop it; this is the only way out.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-number " \fIcars\fR"
Specify the number of cars (1\-100).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ls (1)
.SH BUGS
It sometimes lists directory contents.
.SH AUTHOR
Toyoda Masashi (mtoyoda@acm.org),
with additions by Markus M\(:uller and others.
